cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StreamDecisionBench (SDB), please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "StreamDecisionBench: Evaluating Decisions in Force on Evolving Language Streams"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-30
abstract: >-
  StreamDecisionBench (SDB) evaluates a language model used as a decision
  component inside an application by the decision in force at every instant,
  and attributes every erroneous instant to judgment, latency or both. Its
  scenarios stream evidence in four application families (IDE debugging, an
  assembly station, a support call and presenter voice control), with
  reference decisions computed from public rules by executable code.
